<%# locals: (text:) %>
<%# A short word that says something about a bank transaction needs a second look, such as "Doesn't add up" or "Deleted in Splitwise": a `badge-warning` on one line (so a narrow row doesn't wrap it out of its pill), whose words carry the meaning and never the colour. %>
<span class="badge badge-warning badge-sm whitespace-nowrap"><%= text %></span>
